# 🔌 Pin Connections

| Component | Connection |
|-----------|------------|
| 9V Battery (+) | Laser Module (+), Buzzer (+), Circuit VCC |
| 9V Battery (-) | Common GND |
| Laser Module (+) | 9V Battery (+) *(or VCC if using a regulated laser module)* |
| Laser Module (-) | GND |
| LDR Pin 1 | VCC |
| LDR Pin 2 | 10kΩ Resistor and Transistor Base |
| 10kΩ Resistor | LDR Pin 2 to GND |
| BC547 Collector | Buzzer (-) and LED (-) |
| BC547 Base | LDR Output |
| BC547 Emitter | GND |
| Buzzer (+) | VCC |
| Buzzer (-) | BC547 Collector |
| LED (+) | VCC through 220Ω Resistor |
| LED (-) | BC547 Collector |